    <section class="ms-hero mb-4">
        <h1 class="h2 fw-bold mb-2">1.3 What are Microservices?</h1>
        <p class="mb-2">In this lesson, we will understand microservices from zero to practical level using examples, visuals, and interview-focused notes.</p>
        <a href="/Microservices/Section/course-introduction" class="btn btn-sm btn-light mt-2">← Back to Course Introduction (Microservices with ASP.NET Core – Complete Syllabus)</a>
